1
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:09,490
Story of Two Classmates

2
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:27,240
Hung is writing when Nam accidentally bumps elbow into Hung, making pen draw a very ugly line.

3
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:40,850
Too angry, Hung pushes Nam until Nam's notebook page is ruined.

4
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:47,380
Nam turns red all over face.

5
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:54,720
Hung sees regretful wants to apologize to Nam.

6
00:00:56,480 --> 00:01:08,200
After school, Nam follows Hung, smiles kindly:

7
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:16,050
"We are still friends like before!"

8
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:25,710
Hung surprised, then moved hugs friend tightly.

